## Full API‑provided descriptions

### citizenM Los Angeles Downtown (`hotel_7120140`)
> “Stay in the heart of Los Angeles. Conveniently situated in the centre of Los Angeles, citizenM Los Angeles Downtown provides air‑conditioned rooms, a shared lounge, free Wi‑Fi and a restaurant. This 4‑star hotel offers a bar. The property is non‑smoking and is located 1.6 km from LA Union Station.  
> At the hotel, each room comes with a desk, a flat‑screen TV, a private bathroom, bed linen and towels. Guest rooms are equipped with free toiletries and an iPad. Guests can enjoy a buffet breakfast. The hotel has a 24‑hour front desk, a business centre and ironing service. Microsoft Theater is 2.4 km away, Staples Center 2.5 km away, Hawthorne Municipal Airport 20 km away.”

**Key amenities:** Free Wi‑Fi, rooftop terrace, 24‑hour canteen, fitness studio, self‑check‑in kiosk, pet‑friendly (on request).

---

### LA Crystal Hotel – Los Angeles‑Long Beach Area (`hotel_1194086`)
> “Offering a casino, an outdoor pool and a fitness centre, LA Crystal Hotel – Los Angeles‑Long Beach Area is located 17.3 km away from Los Angeles International Airport. All guest rooms include free Wi‑Fi access. A flat‑screen cable TV and a refrigerator are included in each air‑conditioned room. Private bathrooms come with a hair‑dryer, a mini‑refrigerator, and free toiletries.  
> The hotel also features a hot tub, 24‑hour reception, luggage storage, car‑hire services, vending machines, free parking and an on‑site bar. Long Beach and LAX are both less than 20 minutes’ drive from the property; Downtown Los Angeles is 28 km away, while Disneyland is 30 km away.”

**Key amenities:** Free Wi‑Fi, complimentary breakfast, outdoor heated pool, fitness centre, free parking, airport shuttle (on request).

---

### Crowne Plaza Hotel Los Angeles Harbor, an IHG Hotel (`hotel_185321`)
> “Only 4 blocks from The World Cruise Center, this hotel in San Pedro overlooks the Port of Los Angeles. Guests can enjoy an on‑site swimming pool and restaurant. A cable TV and coffee machine are standard in every room. All rooms include free Wi‑Fi and a work desk.  
> Crowne Plaza Hotel Los Angeles Harbor features a well‑equipped fitness centre. Guests can also enjoy breakfast, lunch and dinner at the hotel’s Blu Restaurant, then a drink in the on‑site lounge. Points of interest such as the Long Beach Convention Center and Trump National Golf Course are within a short drive of the hotel. Guests can also explore the Long Beach Aquarium of the Pacific, which is 13 km away.”

**Key amenities:** Free Wi‑Fi, outdoor heated pool, fitness centre, rooftop lounge, on‑site restaurant, complimentary shuttle service.

---

